# delta — core-S03-timing.json（holiday-aware-timing）

## ADDED — flows：节假日感知（2 个 flow）

> 追加到 `flows` 数组末尾（数组形态，元素即 2 个 flow）。case_id 复用 test-cases.md 的 ST-S03-22/23。节假日数据随镜像发布（fixed-value），编排直接使用打包数据，无需 mock——断言只约束「触发日为周末且不在打包数据的 workdays 中」与「evidence 含 calendar」，不依赖具体年份的节日安排。

```json
  [
    {
      "case_id": "ST-S03-22",
      "type": "normal",
      "description": "手动设置 free_weekend 命中真实休息日（非调休上班日）",
      "covers_steps": "主路径 Step 5 增补 + EX-P.6 退化边界由 UT 覆盖",
      "steps": [
        { "step": "前置：种下一个愿望", "method": "POST", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/wishes", "headers": { "Authorization": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }, "body": { "source": "text", "text": "想去看一次日出" }, "expected_status": 201, "extract": { "wish_id": "body.wish.id" } },
        { "step": "Step 5 增补: 设置 free_weekend", "method": "PUT", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/wishes/{{wish_id}}/timing", "headers": { "Authorization": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }, "body": { "type": "free_weekend" }, "expected_status": 200, "assert": ["body.state == 'brewing'", "body.timing.next_trigger_at != null"] },
        { "step": "断言触发日为周末且非打包数据的调休上班日（服务端计算）", "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/wishes/{{wish_id}}", "headers": { "Authorization": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }, "expected_status": 200, "assert": ["body.timing.trigger_kind == 'time'", "weekday(body.timing.next_trigger_at) in (5, 6)", "not in_workdays(body.timing.next_trigger_at)"] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "case_id": "ST-S03-23",
      "type": "normal",
      "description": "建议理由可引用节假日：evidence 含 calendar 条目，确认后提醒链路不变",
      "covers_steps": "分支 P3/P11/P12 增补",
      "steps": [
        { "step": "前置：种下一个愿望", "method": "POST", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/wishes", "headers": { "Authorization": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }, "body": { "source": "text", "text": "想在冬天学会滑雪" }, "expected_status": 201, "extract": { "wish_id": "body.wish.id" } },
        { "step": "前置：LLM mock 置为 propose_timing（理由引用节假日事实）", "method": "PUT", "url": "{{mock_base}}/_control", "body": { "mode": "propose_timing" }, "expected_status": 204 },
        { "step": "P2→P10: 生成建议", "method": "POST", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/wishes/{{wish_id}}/timing-proposals", "headers": { "Authorization": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }, "expected_status": 200, "extract": { "proposal_id": "body.proposal.id" }, "assert": ["body.proposal.status == 'pending'", "body.proposal.validation.valid == true"] },
        { "step": "P11: evidence 含 calendar 条目（有打包数据的年份）或为空（缺年份降级）", "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/wishes/{{wish_id}}/timing-proposals", "headers": { "Authorization": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }, "expected_status": 200, "assert": ["every(e in body.items[0].evidence : e.kind != 'calendar' or starts_with(e.id, 'holidays-'))"] },
        { "step": "P12→P15: 确认建议", "method": "POST", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/wishes/{{wish_id}}/timing-proposals/{{proposal_id}}/confirm", "headers": { "Authorization": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }, "body": {}, "expected_status": 200, "assert": ["body.wish.state == 'brewing'", "body.proposal.status == 'confirmed'"] },
        { "step": "确认后的提醒链路与节假日无关（文案仍为模板拼接）", "method": "GET", "url": "{{mock_base}}/_stats", "expected_status": 200, "assert": ["body.chat_completions_calls == 0"] }
      ]
    }
  ]
```

> 节假日数据不引入 mock 控制面：数据文件即 fixed-value（架构第七节同步条目）。`in_workdays` / `weekday` / `starts_with` 为 runner 的内置断言辅助函数，属 code 阶段编排 runner 的实现要求。
